<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Form 5500 Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td, th { padding: 5px; text-align: left; }
  .header-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .form-title { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-heading { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .sub-heading { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; }
  .field-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .field-group { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
  .field-item { flex: 1; }
  .signature-block { margin-top: 50px; }
  .signature-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px; }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header-row td {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .header-row td {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 5px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-row td {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-section">
    <div>
      <div class="form-title">Form 5500</div>
      <div>OMB No. 1210-0110</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="form-title">Annual Return/Report of Employee Benefit Plan</div>
      <div>1210-0089</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>This form is required to be filed for employee benefit plans under sections 104 and 4065 of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974 (ERISA) and sections 605(b) and 605(c) of the Internal Revenue Code (the Code).</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p><strong>&raquo;</strong> Complete all entries in accordance with the instructions to the Form 5500.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="field-container">
      <div class="field-item">
        <span class="section-heading">Part I Annual Report Identification Information</span>
        <p>For calendar plan year <span data-field="plan_year_start_date">{{ plan_year_start_date }}</span> and ending <span data-field="plan_year_end_date">{{ plan_year_end_date }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="field-item" style="text-align: right;">
        <p>This Form is Open to Public Inspection</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>A This return/report is:</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="a1" name="a1"> <label for="a1">a multiple-employer plan</label><br>
        <input type="checkbox" id="a2" name="a2"> <label for="a2">a single-employer plan</label>
      </div>
      <p>B This return/report is:</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="b1" name="b1"> <label for="b1">the first return/report</label><br>
        <input type="checkbox" id="b2" name="b2"> <label for="b2">an amended return/report</label>
      </div>
      <p>C If the plan is a collectively-bargained plan, check here:</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="c1" name="c1"> <label for="c1">yes</label>
      </div>
      <p>D Check box if filing under:</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="d1" name="d1"> <label for="d1">Form 5500</label>
        <input type="checkbox" id="d2" name="d2"> <label for="d2">automatic extension</label>
        <input type="checkbox" id="d3" name="d3"> <label for="d3">the DFVC program</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <span class="section-heading">Part II Basic Plan Information—enter all requested information</span>
      <div class="field-container">
        <div class="field-item">
          <p>1a Name of plan</p>
          <p><span data-field="plan_name">{{ plan_name }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="field-item" style="text-align: right;">
          <p>1b Three-digit plan number (PN)</p>
          <p><span data-field="plan_number">{{ plan_number }}</span></p>
          <p>1c Effective date of plan</p>
          <p><span data-field="plan_effective_date">{{ plan_effective_date }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field-container">
        <div class="field-item">
          <p>2a Plan sponsor's name (employer, if for a single-employer plan)</p>
          <p><span data-field="sponsor_name">{{ sponsor_name }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="field-item" style="text-align: right;">
          <p>2b Employer Identification Number (EIN)</p>
          <p><span data-field="sponsor_ein">{{ sponsor_ein }}</span></p>
          <p>2c Plan Sponsor's telephone number</p>
          <p><span data-field="sponsor_phone">{{ sponsor_phone }}</span></p>
          <p>2d Business code (see instructions)</p>
          <p><span data-field="business_code">{{ business_code }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>3a Plan administrator's name and address</p>
        <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
          <input type="checkbox" id="3a_yes" name="3a_yes"> <label for="3a_yes">Same as Plan Sponsor</label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>4 If the name and/or EIN of the plan sponsor or the plan name has changed since the last return/report filed for this plan, enter the plan sponsor's name, EIN, the plan name and the plan number from the last return/report:</p>
        <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
          <p>a Sponsor's name</p>
          <p><span data-field="last_sponsor_name">{{ last_sponsor_name }}</span></p>
          <p>b Plan Name</p>
          <p><span data-field="last_plan_name">{{ last_plan_name }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>5 Total number of participants at the beginning of the plan year</p>
        <p><span data-field="total_participants_start">{{ total_participants_start }}</span></p>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
          <p>5 Total</p>
          <p><span data-field="total_participants_start_right">{{ total_participants_start_right }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>6 Number of participants as of the end of the plan year unless otherwise stated (welfare plans complete only lines 6a(1), 6a(2), 6b, 6c, and 6d).</p>
        <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
          <p>a(1) Total number of active participants at the beginning of the plan year</p>
          <p><span data-field="active_participants_start">{{ active_participants_start }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6a(1)</p>
            <p><span data-field="active_participants_start_right">{{ active_participants_start_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
          <p>a(2) Total number of active participants at the end of the plan year</p>
          <p><span data-field="active_participants_end">{{ active_participants_end }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6a(2)</p>
            <p><span data-field="active_participants_end_right">{{ active_participants_end_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
          <p>b Retired or separated participants receiving benefits</p>
          <p><span data-field="retired_separated_receiving_benefits">{{ retired_separated_receiving_benefits }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6b</p>
            <p><span data-field="retired_separated_receiving_benefits_right">{{ retired_separated_receiving_benefits_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
          <p>c Other retired or separated participants entitled to future benefits</p>
          <p><span data-field="other_retired_separated_entitled_future_benefits">{{ other_retired_separated_entitled_future_benefits }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6c</p>
            <p><span data-field="other_retired_separated_entitled_future_benefits_right">{{ other_retired_separated_entitled_future_benefits_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
          <p>d Subtotal. Add lines 6a(2), 6b, and 6c.</p>
          <p><span data-field="subtotal_participants">{{ subtotal_participants }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6d</p>
            <p><span data-field="subtotal_participants_right">{{ subtotal_participants_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
          <p>e Deceased participants whose beneficiaries are receiving or are entitled to receive benefits.</p>
          <p><span data-field="deceased_participants">{{ deceased_participants }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6e</p>
            <p><span data-field="deceased_participants_right">{{ deceased_participants_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
          <p>f Total. Add lines 6d and 6e.</p>
          <p><span data-field="total_participants_end">{{ total_participants_end }}</span></p>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>6f</p>
            <p><span data-field="total_participants_end_right">{{ total_participants_end_right }}</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>g Number of participants with account balances as of the end of the plan year (only defined contribution plans complete this item).</p>
        <p><span data-field="participants_with_account_balances">{{ participants_with_account_balances }}</span></p>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
          <p>6g</p>
          <p><span data-field="participants_with_account_balances_right">{{ participants_with_account_balances_right }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>h Number of participants who terminated employment during the plan year with accrued benefits that were less than 100% vested.</p>
        <p><span data-field="terminated_participants_less_than_100_vested">{{ terminated_participants_less_than_100_vested }}</span></p>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
          <p>6h</p>
          <p><span data-field="terminated_participants_less_than_100_vested_right">{{ terminated_participants_less_than_100_vested_right }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>i If the plan provides pension benefits, enter the applicable pension feature codes from the List of Plan Characteristics Codes in the instructions:</p>
        <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
          <p>4A</p>
          <p><span data-field="pension_feature_code_4a">{{ pension_feature_code_4a }}</span></p>
          <p>4D</p>
          <p><span data-field="pension_feature_code_4d">{{ pension_feature_code_4d }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <span class="section-heading">Part III Form M-1 Compliance Information (to be completed by welfare benefit plans)</span>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>11a If the plan provides welfare benefits, was the plan subject to the Form M-1 filing requirements during the plan year? (See instructions and 29 CFR 2520.101-2).</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <input type="radio" name="m1_filing_yes" value="yes"> <label>Yes</label>
        <input type="radio" name="m1_filing_no" value="no"> <label>No</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>11b If the plan currently in compliance with the Form M-1 filing requirements? (See instructions and 29 CFR 2520.101-2).</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <input type="radio" name="m1_compliance_yes" value="yes"> <label>Yes</label>
        <input type="radio" name="m1_compliance_no" value="no"> <label>No</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>11c Enter the Receipt Confirmation Code for the 2020 Form M-1 annual report. If the plan was not required to file the 2020 Form M-1 annual report, enter the Receipt Confirmation Code for the most recent Form M-1 that was required to be filed under the Form M-1 filing requirements. (Failure to enter a valid Receipt Confirmation Code will subject the Form 5500 filing to rejection as incomplete.)</p>
      <p><span data-field="receipt_confirmation_code">{{ receipt_confirmation_code }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <span class="section-heading">SCHEDULE A (Form 5500) Insurance Information</span>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>This schedule is required to be filed under section 104 of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974 (ERISA).</p>
      <p>File as an attachment to Form 5500.</p>
      <div class="field-container">
        <div class="field-item">
          <p>For calendar plan year <span data-field="schedule_a_plan_year_start_date">{{ schedule_a_plan_year_start_date }}</span> and ending <span data-field="schedule_a_plan_year_end_date">{{ schedule_a_plan_year_end_date }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="field-item" style="text-align: right;">
          <p>B Three-digit plan number (PN)</p>
          <p><span data-field="schedule_a_plan_number">{{ schedule_a_plan_number }}</span></p>
          <p>D Employer Identification Number (EIN)</p>
          <p><span data-field="schedule_a_ein">{{ schedule_a_ein }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Part I Information Concerning Insurance Contract Coverage, Fees, and Commissions Provide information for each contract on a separate Schedule A. Individual contracts grouped as a unit in Parts II and III can be reported on a single Schedule A.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>1 Coverage Information:</p>
      <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width: 10%;"> (a) Name of insurance carrier</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (b) EIN</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (c) NAIC code</th>
            <th style="width: 25%;"> (d) Contract or identification number</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;"> (e) Approximate number of persons covered at end of policy or contract year</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (f) From</th>
            <th style="width: 10%;"> (g) To</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_name">{{ carrier_name }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_ein">{{ carrier_ein }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_naic_code">{{ carrier_naic_code }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_contract_id">{{ carrier_contract_id }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_persons_covered">{{ carrier_persons_covered }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_from_date">{{ carrier_from_date }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="carrier_to_date">{{ carrier_to_date }}</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>2 Insurance fee and commission information. Enter the total fees and total commissions paid. List in line 3 the agents, brokers, and other persons in descending order of the amount paid.</p>
      <p>a) Total amount of commissions paid</p>
      <p><span data-field="total_commissions_paid">{{ total_commissions_paid }}</span></p>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <p>(b) Total amount of fees paid</p>
        <p><span data-field="total_fees_paid">{{ total_fees_paid }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>3 Persons receiving commissions and fees. (Complete as many entries as needed to report all persons).</p>
      <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width: 30%;"> (a) Name and address of the agent, broker, or other person to whom commissions or fees were paid</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;"> (b) Amount of sales and base commissions paid</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;"> (c) Amount</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (d) Purpose</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (e) Organization code</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in commission_recipients %}
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients[{{ loop.index0 }}].name_address">{{ commission_recipients[loop.index0].name_address }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients[{{ loop.index0 }}].sales_base_commissions_paid">{{ commission_recipients[loop.index0].sales_base_commissions_paid }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ commission_recipients[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients[{{ loop.index0 }}].purpose">{{ commission_recipients[loop.index0].purpose }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients[{{ loop.index0 }}].organization_code">{{ commission_recipients[loop.index0].organization_code }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>For Paperwork Reduction Act Notice, see the Instructions for Form 5500.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page">
    <span class="section-heading">Schedule A (Form 5500) Page 2</span>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>This schedule is required to be filed under section 104 of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974 (ERISA).</p>
      <p>File as an attachment to Form 5500.</p>
      <div class="field-container">
        <div class="field-item">
          <p>For calendar plan year <span data-field="schedule_a_page2_plan_year_start_date">{{ schedule_a_page2_plan_year_start_date }}</span> and ending <span data-field="schedule_a_page2_plan_year_end_date">{{ schedule_a_page2_plan_year_end_date }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="field-item" style="text-align: right;">
          <p>B Three-digit plan number (PN)</p>
          <p><span data-field="schedule_a_page2_plan_number">{{ schedule_a_page2_plan_number }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Part I Information Concerning Insurance Contract Coverage, Fees, and Commissions Provide information for each contract on a separate Schedule A. Individual contracts grouped as a unit in Parts II and III can be reported on a single Schedule A.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>1 Coverage Information:</p>
      <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width: 30%;"> (a) Name and address of the agent, broker, or other person to whom commissions or fees were paid</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;"> (b) Amount of sales and base commissions paid</th>
            <th style="width: 20%;"> (c) Amount</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (d) Purpose</th>
            <th style="width: 15%;"> (e) Organization code</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for item in commission_recipients_page2 %}
          <tr>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].name_address">{{ commission_recipients_page2[loop.index0].name_address }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].sales_base_commissions_paid">{{ commission_recipients_page2[loop.index0].sales_base_commissions_paid }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ commission_recipients_page2[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].purpose">{{ commission_recipients_page2[loop.index0].purpose }}</span></td>
            <td><span data-field="commission_recipients_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].organization_code">{{ commission_recipients_page2[loop.index0].organization_code }}</span></td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>For Paperwork Reduction Act Notice, see the Instructions for Form 5500.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page">
    <span class="section-heading">Schedule A (Form 5500) Page 3</span>
    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>Part II Investment and Annuity Contract Information</p>
      <p>Where individual contracts are provided, the entire group of such individual contracts with each carrier may be treated as a unit for purposes of this report.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>4 Current value of plan's interest under this contract in the general account at year end</p>
      <p><span data-field="current_value_general_account">{{ current_value_general_account }}</span></p>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <p>4</p>
        <p><span data-field="current_value_general_account_right">{{ current_value_general_account_right }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>5 Current value of plan's interest under this contract in separate accounts at year end.</p>
      <p><span data-field="current_value_separate_accounts">{{ current_value_separate_accounts }}</span></p>
      <div style="text-align: right;">
        <p>5</p>
        <p><span data-field="current_value_separate_accounts_right">{{ current_value_separate_accounts_right }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>6 Contracts With Allocated Funds:</p>
      <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
        <p>a State the basis of premium rates</p>
        <p><span data-field="basis_premium_rates">{{ basis_premium_rates }}</span></p>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
          <p>6b</p>
          <p><span data-field="basis_premium_rates_right">{{ basis_premium_rates_right }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <p>b Premiums paid to carrier</p>
        <p><span data-field="premiums_paid_to_carrier">{{ premiums_paid_to_carrier }}</span></p>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
          <p>6c</p>
          <p><span data-field="premiums_paid_to_carrier_right">{{ premiums_paid_to_carrier_right }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <p>c Premiums due but unpaid at the end of the year</p>
